Package: camora
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Taptic Labs
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, zlib1g, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-libav, gstreamer1.0-pipewire, pipewire, librsvg2-common, libpipewire-0.3-0 | libpipewire-0.3-0t64
Description: AI camera effects and virtual camera for Linux
 Camora captures a physical camera once, applies live AI effects, and publishes
 the processed result as a PipeWire virtual camera for applications such as OBS.
 NVIDIA CUDA is used when its runtime and driver are usable; CPU is the automatic
 fallback.
